  [➕ Feature]: Batch Enrichment by CEL Expression
This is ChatGPT generated description

## Description
Implement a new endpoint that allows users to enrich multiple alerts at once by specifying a CEL (Common Expression Language) query instead of listing individual alert fingerprints.

## Use Cases
- Enrich alerts by attributes like severity or name pattern
- Target alerts with specific labels or properties
- Bulk acknowledge alerts from specific regions or services
- Apply status changes to groups of related alerts

## Examples
```
// Acknowledge all critical severity alerts
{
  "cel": "labels.severity == 'critical'",
  "enrichments": {
    "status": "acknowledged"
  }
}

// Assign all memory-related alerts in a specific region
{
  "cel": "name.contains('Memory') && labels.region == 'us-east-1'",
  "enrichments": {
    "assignee": "infrastructure-team@example.com"
  }
}
```
